# The image badge as a link to its file (`image_attachments.zig:1336-1340`):
# in the composer once attached, on the card once sent, and on the card a
# relaunch replays.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
wait 4
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 2
snap attached
type  what is in this image?
key Enter
wait 5
snap sent
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 6
snap resumed
